{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1058424-2e-power-of-sympathies-or-how-you-cannot-forget-nakatomi","id":1058424,"title":"[2E] Power of Sympathies - Or how you cannot forget Nakatomi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-05T08:33:00-08:00","id":1058424,"title":"[2E] Power of Sympathies - Or how you cannot forget Nakatomi","content":"This topic is about how, basically, in Awakened society nothing can be forgotten just by existence of Space and Time magic. Example comes from Tokyo Mystery of who was Nakatomi Hierarch from 2E corebook - but it's only illustration of 'problem' with rules-to-setting translation. In <i>Fallen Blossoms</i> Dark Era - 'shogunate historical setting in Tokyo' - there is answer to the question of Nakatomi identity. I will not spoil it here, but from analyzing Arcana possibilities I just cannot see how modern, XXI century mages would not know how was their famous local leader 500 years earlier. Or rather still being unsolved Mystery. Need to see Nakatomi? Just find item from Edo period - like real katana or samurai armor and item from modern Tokyo - and take one Space and one Time mage. Space one cast Scrying Window on Old Tokyo town area, for example Emperor court. Time mage use ancient item to have Sympathy with Edo period. Voila, we can all the time see how Edo was rising from fishing town. And Nakatomi was somewhere there. Take few days of this research, and Mystery will be nonMystery. So it should not be Mystery in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-05-2017, 12:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T08:42:10-08:00","id":1058426,"title":"","content":"As I and others said in the Fallen Blossoms thread, the fact that it still is a Mystery is probably half of the Mystery in an of itself. Records corrupted, people distancing themselves from history, and magical oddities like temporal Ansho could all combine to keep Nakatomi mysterious. If the combo you've pointed out here works as intended (and I'm going to let others analyze that), that just enhances the mystery to me, not diminishing it or breaking willing suspension of disbelief.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T08:44:17-08:00","id":1058429,"title":"","content":"Seconded. A lot of records <i>did</i> go up in flames before the present day.<br /> <br /> That said, I have a feeling that part of the reason Nakatomi is subject to a Mystery is because other Awakened might be going out of their way to obfuscate the facts to strengthen their own political position. Heck, the predominant faction in Nakatomi-En would practically lose all their influence in one day if the revelation went public.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-05T08:55:45-08:00","id":1058431,"title":"","content":"I don't think that's how Temporal Sympathy works...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.